{"source":{"data":"@method=POST @endpoint=dr/on-unsubscribe\nFeature: callback for Unsubscribe from SR\n\nThis API is to be exposed by the DR.\nIt will be called by the SP systems or other registeries .\n\n    @smoke\n    Scenario: Successfully  receive async unsubscribe results from DR\n        Given SP has previously sent an unsubscribe request to DR\n        When DR completes processing and calls SP on-unsubscribe callback\n        Then SP should receive the on-unsubscribe response from DR\n        And The on-unsubscribe response should have status 200\n        And The on-unsubscribe response should have \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" header\n        And The on-unsubscribe response should be returned in a timely manner 15000ms\n        And The on-unsubscribe response should match json schema","uri":"features/dr_on-unsubscribe.feature","mediaType":"text/x.cucumber.gherkin+plain"}}
