{"source":{"data":"@method=POST @endpoint=dr/unsubscribe\nFeature: Unsubscribe from DR based on specific criteria\n\nThis API is to be exposed by the DR.\nIt will be called by the SP systems or other registeries .\n\n    @smoke\n    Scenario: Successfully unsubscribe from DR to be processed smoke type test\n        Given System wanna unsubscribe from DR\n        When POST request to unsubscribe is sent\n        Then The response from the unsubscribe is received\n        And The unsubscribe response should have status 200\n        And The unsubscribe response should have \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" header\n        And The unsubscribe response should be returned in a timely manner 15000ms\n        And The unsubscribe response should match json schema","uri":"features/dr_unsubscribe.feature","mediaType":"text/x.cucumber.gherkin+plain"}}
